aim":"Lula said the tax reform text was the politically possible version rather than the preferred economic design, showing a willingness to present compromise as achievement.","publisher":"Reuters via UOL","date":"2023-07-06","type":"wire reporting","confidence":"high","use":"final_evidence","period":"target_year","attribution":"direct presidential rhetoric","contrary":["The statement is candid about compromise, but it still uses political framing to present the outcome positively."]},{"id":"E022","claim":"Lula publicly said the government needed Congress and that the left had at most 136 votes, framing his administration as one that must negotiate rather than dominate.","publisher":"Reuters via UOL","date":"2023-06-02","type":"wire reporting","confidence":"high","use":"final_evidence","period":"target_year","attribution":"direct presidential rhetoric","contrary":["Being candid about constraints does not by itself prove honesty in other domains."]},{"id":"E036","claim":"The TCU approved Lula's 2023 accounts with reservations, finding the budget and accounts generally lawful but identifying fiscal, transparency, and revenue-renunciation problems.","publisher":"Tribunal de Contas da União","date":"2024-06-12","type":"audit decision","confidence":"high","use":"final_evidence","period":"later_retrospective_on_2023","attribution":"independent audit of Lula's 2023 administration","contrary":["The approval was not clean; the TCU identified multiple reservations and irregularities."]},{"id":"E050","claim":"The STF opened and expanded investigations into the January 8 anti-democratic attacks, demonstrating active judicial constraint on destabilizing actors.","publisher":"Supremo Tribunal Federal","date":"2023-01-26","type":"court news","confidence":"high","use":"final_evidence","period":"target_year","attribution":"independent judicial check under Lula's presidency","contrary":["Judicial activism can be criticized, but that criticism does not negate the existence of constraint."]}]}
