nfidence":"high","use":"final_evidence","period":"immediate_retrospective","attribution":"strong","contrary":["SCMP compiles official announcements and may mix corruption with political discipline; still strong evidence of persistent problems."]},{"id":"E015","claim":"China's CCDI vowed to crack down on corruption in finance, SOEs, and grain purchasing, warning against political-business collusion.","publisher":"Reuters","date":"2023-02-23","type":"news_report","confidence":"high","use":"final_evidence","period":"target_period","attribution":"direct","contrary":["The need for such a crackdown suggests corruption remained acute rather than eliminated."]},{"id":"E016","claim":"Reuters described Li Shangfu's disappearance as part of a recurring pattern in which senior officials vanish before CCDI investigations are announced, reinforcing the opacity of the system.","publisher":"Reuters","date":"2023-09-22","type":"news_report","confidence":"high","use":"final_evidence","period":"target_period","attribution":"strong","contrary":["This pattern may reflect internal discipline as well as concealment; the lack of public process is the key problem."]},{"id":"E017","claim":"The CPC Central Committee ordered the whole Party to study Xi's selected works and align thinking, stance, and action with the Central Committee with Xi at its core.","publisher":"Xinhua / SCIO","date":"2023-04-11","type":"official_party_notice","confidence":"high","use":"final_evidence","period":"target_period","attribution":"direct","contrary":["This normalizes personalist authority rather than independent institutional ethics."]},{"id":"E064","claim":"The U.S. State Department's 2023 China report described arbitrary detention, torture, lack of judicial independence, censorship, surveillance, and serious restrictions on political participation and elections.","publisher":"www.ecoi.net","date":"unknown_not_exposed_by_source","type":"unknown_not_recorded","confidence":"unknown_not_recorded","use":"final_evidence","period":"unknown_not_recorded","attribution":"unknown_not_recorded","contrary":[]},{"id":"E070","claim":"Qin Gang's disappearance and removal in July 2023 showed highly opaque elite politics under Xi and the lack of a public explanation for a major foreign-policy personnel change.","publisher":"www.investing.com","date":"unknown_not_exposed_by_source","type":"unknown_not_recorded","confidence":"unknown_not_recorded","use":"final_evidence","period":"unknown_not_recorded","attribution":"unknown_not_recorded","contrary":[]},{"id":"E073","claim":"China's constitution gives formal supremacy to the National People's Congress and assigns it powers over legislation, senior appointments, war and peace, and removal of top officials, even though party control dominates practice.","publisher":"www.npc.gov.cn","date":"unknown_not_exposed_by_source","type":"unknown_not_recorded","confidence":"unknown_not_recorded","use":"final_evidence","period":"unknown_not_recorded","attribution":"unknown_not_recorded","contrary":[]},{"id":"E074","claim":"Xi Jinping held the top party, state, and military offices in 2023: CPC general secretary, PRC president, and chairman of both Central Military Commissions.","publisher":"en.npc.gov.cn.cdurl.cn","date":"unknown_not_exposed_by_source","type":"unknown_not_recorded","confidence":"unknown_not_recorded","use":"final_evidence","period":"unknown_not_recorded","attribution":"unknown_not_recorded","contrary":[]},{"id":"E089","claim":"Xi framed auditing as part of Party self-reform and centralized Party-state supervision.","publisher":"Xinhua / State Council portal","date":"2023-05-23","type":"official_statement","confidence":"high","use":"final_evidence","period":"target_period","attribution":"direct","contrary":["This is internal discipline, not independent accountability."]},{"id":"E090","claim":"Xi Jinping’s selected works were promoted in 2023 as an authoritative resource for the Party and nation.","publisher":"Xinhua / SCIO","date":"2023-04-04","type":"official_publication_notice","confidence":"high","use":"final_evidence","period":"target_period","attribution":"direct","contrary":["Publication demonstrates official elevation of Xi’s ideas, not their truth."]},{"id":"E091","claim":"Qin Gang was removed after a month-long disappearance without a clear public explanation.","publisher":"Washington Post","date":"2023-07-25","type":"news_report","confidence":"high","use":"final_evidence","period":"target_period","attribution":"strong","contrary":["The underlying reason remained undisclosed."]},{"id":"E092","claim":"Li Shangfu disappeared amid a corruption probe linked to military procurement, without transparent official explanation.","publisher":"Reuters","date":"2023-09-16","type":"news_report","confidence":"high","use":"final_evidence","period":"target_period","attribution":"strong","contrary":["Public details were sparse and some reported facts remained unconfirmed."]},{"id":"E093","claim":"The CCDI reported about 110,000 Party officials facing disciplinary action in 2023.","publisher":"South China Morning Post","date":"2024-01-30","type":"news_report","confidence":"high","use":"final_evidence","period":"immediate_retrospective","attribution":"institutional","contrary":["Disciplinary actions are not equivalent to convictions and may include political discipline."]}]}
