nipur beginning 3 May 2023; reporting described it as lasting nearly three months, limiting access to information and delaying visibility of abuses.","publisher":"TIME","date":"2023","type":"international_news_report","confidence":"high","use":"final_evidence","period":"target_period","attribution":"moderate_shared_union_state","contrary":["Authorities defended the shutdown as necessary to curb rumors and violence; the source does not establish a personal Union order."]}]}
